           SHORT="Simple application to manage Xfce panel layouts"

cat << EOF
Xfce4-panel-profiles is a simple application to manage Xfce panel layouts.
With the modular Xfce Panel, a multitude of panel layouts can be created. This
tool makes it possible to backup, restore, import, and export these panel
layouts.
EOF
